       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-WEYL-VERLET.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WEYL-VERLET-PROOFS.
           05  WS-VERLET-FET-DISCHARGE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SYMPLECTIC-TIME-REVERSE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONSTRAIN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPRING-MASS-DISCHARGE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-VERLET-SOVEREIGN-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-VERLET-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-VERLET-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-VERLET-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FET-AND-SYMPLECTIC.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-WEYL-AND-SPRINGS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-VERLET-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FET-AND-SYMPLECTIC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VERLET-FET-DISCHARGE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SYMPLECTIC-TIME-REVERSE.
       2000-EVALUATE-WEYL-AND-SPRINGS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONSTRAIN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPRING-MASS-DISCHARGE.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-VERLET-PROOFS.
           IF WS-VERLET-FET-DISCHARGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SYMPLECTIC-TIME-REVERSE = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONSTRAIN = 1 AND
              WS-SPRING-MASS-DISCHARGE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-VERLET-SOVEREIGN-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-VERLET-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-VERLET-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-VERLET-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-VERLET-CODE.
